# Doom port (Phase 5.2) -- see docs/README.md.
#
# build/ is pure output: 88 object files, ~17 MB, regenerated by `make`.
#
# src/ is ~180 files of vendored doomgeneric / linuxdoom source, tracked
# upstream rather than here. NOTE the pattern is "src/*", not "src/" --
# git will not descend into an excluded DIRECTORY, so the negations below
# would silently do nothing against "src/".
#
# The exceptions are the SoC port itself: the doomgeneric platform
# backend, the bare-metal syscall/stub layer, and the memory-backed WAD
# reader that replaces file I/O against the ESP32-loaded DOOM1.WAD in
# SDRAM. Those are written for this project and are not recoverable from
# upstream.

build/

src/*
!src/doomgeneric_soc.c
!src/soc_*.c
!src/w_file_mem.c
